  "statuteText": "261:97 Rulemaking Authority on Dealer Number Plates. –\n\nThe director shall have the authority to adopt rules pursuant to RSA 260:5 relative to the issuance and use of dealer number plates by motor vehicle dealers, motorcycle dealers, OHRV dealers, snowmobile dealers, utility dealers, boat dealers, transporters, repairers and wholesalers consistent with the provisions of this chapter relative to such dealer number plates."
